 ## Subtopics
 
+### [Bjøntegaard Delta PSNR (BD-PSNR) and BD-BR](7176-bj-ntegaard-delta-psnr-bd-psnr-and-bd-br.md)
+Calculates the average quality (BD-PSNR) or bit-rate (BD-BR) difference between two rate-distortion curves. Provides a single scalar for objective compression comparison, avoiding full curve plotting. Chosen when comparing multiple compression techniques across varying bitrates.
+
 ## Operating characteristics
 - **Time Complexity**: $O(1)$ for the calculation itself, assuming MSE values are precomputed [G].
